#> tool: sedrepl
#> wait: 8 lemons 22
#> pause: 45
#> must: --- inventory ---
#> must: 5 figs 25
#> must: (seasonal)
#> must: 7 limes 18
#> not: 7 kiwis 18
#> source: 7 limes
# 7. a, i and c. Sheet: "a" appends text after the pattern, "i" inserts before, "c" changes it.
# Each takes a backslash, then its text on the next line. The text is queued and
# written when the line is output; c also deletes the line it replaces (no kiwis).
# Try: give c a range, 3,6c\ : four lines become one.
1i\
--- inventory ---
/figs/a\
(seasonal)
/kiwis/c\
7 limes 18

#DATA
1 apples 12
5 figs 25
7 kiwis 18
8 lemons 22
